    "name": "[MNWS] Modern Naval Weapon System (SkizzyNaval update)",
    "abstract": "MNWS 2.4 modern warships, missiles, VLS and aircraft updated for KSP 1.12.5 and BDArmory Plus 1.13, with fixes for naval AI combat.",
    "description": "Adds MMPatches/MNWS_BDA113.cfg (removes modules from plugins that no longer exist, updates renamed BDArmory modules and keys, moves fuzes to bullets, SLW homing for torpedoes, naval AI fixes), an optional MNWS_BDA113_Balance.cfg, and the small MNWSFix.dll helper (launch transforms for the AVLS11V/22V/33V and MissleCell2050V vertical launchers, hull bay links, labelled SSBN002 door buttons; source in the repository). No original file is edited. Shipped as a full copy because the CKAN MNWSModernNavalWeaponSystem targets KSP 1.4.4 and depends on BDArmory Continued; this build provides and conflicts with it. Original by Johnny005611, CC BY-SA 4.0.",
